---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---
<Section id="about" title="about">
  <div class="max-w-[62ch] space-y-5 text-base/7 text-pretty text-fg-dim">
    <p>
      I grew up in a small town and taught myself how to use technology to solve problems. My
      experience in sales and operations shapes how I build tools today. I start by looking at
      how people do their work and where a tool could make it easier.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm the <strong class="font-semibold text-fg">Database Coordinator</strong> at{' '}
      <strong class="font-semibold text-fg">Ronald McDonald House Louisville</strong>, where I
      maintain data quality, investigate reporting discrepancies, and automate recurring work.
    </p>
    <p>
      In 2025, I graduated with a degree in Interdisciplinary Studies in Business and certificates
      in Applied Data Analytics and Organizational Leadership. My capstone explored how
      recommendation algorithms shape what people see and how they interact online. I'm also
      interested in expanding access to technology and education in communities like my hometown.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
